  evidence:
  - evidence_type: LLM_SUGGESTION
    source: https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1592.pdf
    notes: 'Nominal source-qualified stock: DSMZ1592,1593 and1593a each explicitly
      list 10 mL of magnesium sulfate heptahydrate stock at7.5 g/L for1000 mL medium.
      MediaDive solutions5518,5736,6270 corroborate the scoped recipe rows. This extends
      the already proposed C-P08 identity to six exact CultureMech occurrences, in
      addition to the frozen KG source_record for ingredient2154. The ingredient2154
      endpoint identifies the solute and supplies medium links; it does not define
      a universal stock concentration. Solvent, complete composition and stock preparation/final-volume
      convention are unreported. Medium make-up water is not evidence for the separately
      prepared stock solvent. Component-list completeness remains UNKNOWN. No stock-to-solute
      equivalence, conversion of frozen percent-volume fields, or global raw-label
      alias is asserted. The six occurrence IDs and frozen raw quantities are retained
      in the paired source ledger; occurrence statistics count these six distinct
      frozen recipe records only, not all uses of ingredient2154 or unique biological
      media.'
